  "job_B8.1.4.4_20251003_114815": {
    "chunk_text": "Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Drihtne: \u00feises folces is sixhund \u00feusend gangendra manna, & \u00feu segst: Ic sylle him Cwyst \u00f0u, bi\u00f0 sceapa o\u00f0\u00f0e hry\u00f0era swa fela ofslagen, \u00fe\u00e6t hi genoh habbon, o\u00f0\u00f0e beo\u00f0 ealle s\u00e6fixas Drihten him andswarode, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Cwyst \u00f0u, is Drihtnes hand unmihtig; Nu rihte \u00f0u gesyhst Moyses com & rehte \u00f0am folce Godes word; he gegaderode hundseofontig manna of Israhela folce; Drihten astah ny\u00f0er \u00feurh genip, & spr\u00e6c to him, & nam of \u00f0am gaste \u00f0e w\u00e6s on Moyse, & sealde \u00d0a belifon twegen men on \u00f0am wicstowum; \u00f0\u00e6ra o\u00f0er hatte Eldad & o\u00feer Meldad; ofer \u00f0a se gast \u00d0a hi witegodon on wicstowe, \u00f0a arn an cnapa, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Eldad & Meldad witegia\u00f0 on & Iosue, Nunes sunu, cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hlaford min Moyses, forbeod him \u00fe\u00e6t. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses: Ne of\u00f0ince \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6t Drihten sylle his gyfe \u00f0am \u00f0e he wille. Moyses & Israheles folces ealdras cyrdon to \u00f0am wicstowum. Wind com fram Drihtne & brohte ofer s\u00e6 \u00f0a fugelas, \u00f0e man coturnices hate\u00f0, & sende on \u00f0a \u00d0a aras \u00f0\u00e6t folc & gaderode ealne d\u00e6g & ealle \u00f0a niht micle m\u00e6nigeo \u00f0\u00e6ra fugela; se \u00f0e lytel \u00dea gyt w\u00e6s fl\u00e6sc on heora to\u00f0um; ne ateorode",
